# Details stay reachable beside a wide conversation, in a narrow window,
# and while the tool panel is open. A popup never changes inline visibility.
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
window 1360 800
expect thread-details-card
press スレッド詳細を切り替え
expect_absent thread-details-card
window 900 800
press スレッド詳細を切り替え
expect thread-details-card
screenshot popover
key escape
expect_absent thread-details-card
press スレッド詳細を切り替え
expect thread-details-card
window 1360 800
expect_absent thread-details-card
press スレッド詳細を切り替え
expect thread-details-card
screenshot inline
press 右パネルを切り替え
expect_absent thread-details-card
press スレッド詳細を切り替え
expect thread-details-card
key escape
expect_absent thread-details-card
press ツールを閉じる
expect thread-details-card
